==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[scepter]] {{i|US}}

===Etymology===
From [[Ancient Greek]] '''[[σκήπτρον]]''' (''skeptron'') "staff, stick, baton", from '''[[σκήπτω]]''' (''skepto'') "to prop, to support, to lean upon a staff"

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# an [[ornamental]] [[staff]] held by a [[ruling]] [[monarch]] as a [[symbol]] of [[power]]

